# GMS lowers the elemental resistance of everything the magician attacks and
# adds final damage too. Both halves are here: GMS's `u = x+1` and `mdR = 4x+4`
# reach 10% and 40% at its nine levels, and this reaches the same over its ten.
#
# The elemental half only matters against bosses; ordinary monsters resist
# nothing. See kBossElementalBase.
name: "Elemental Decrease"
description:
  "Decreases the Elemental Resistance to all of your attacks. Also "
  "permanently increases Final Damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE skill_order: 5 }
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_MAGE skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 10
base { final_dmg_pct: 0.04 ier_pct: 0.01 }
per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.04 ier_pct: 0.01 }
